## Interface: 20506
## Title: BiS Innervate
## Notes: One window for the whole raid: call for Innervate, Mana Tide, Bloodlust or Drums; druids click the face that pulses, the first click locks everyone else out. Healers get a one-click rez / heal / drink button that takes the rezzers first. Combat safe.
